    "status": "draft",
    "summary": "The nine rahi crates are pinned at `=0.6.0` (spec 058). rahi 0.7.1 (crates.io) is the patch on 0.7.0, which adds deployment epochs, remote identity, and the split N=3 overlay, all behind items and environment variables this cell does not use, so a cell that calls only `rahi_cli::run` needs no code change. 0.7.0 also moves `rahi-kernel` to action-gate-core `=0.3.0`, which removes the second action-gate-core copy spec 058 D-3 recorded. This spec moves all nine pins in one change, keeps the exact-pin rule, re-runs the supply-chain revisit spec 010 requires at a chassis bump, and replaces the partial bump dependabot proposed in #72, which moved seven of the nine crates and broke spec 046's one-version invariant on main.\n",
    "title": "Move every chassis pin to rahi 0.7.1 together, and drop the second action-gate-core"
  },
